  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 200°C (392°F).",
    "Mix the almond flour, baked oats, and bhuna curry paste in a bowl.",
    "Crack in the eggs and mix until a dough forms.",
    "Add the grated cheddar cheese and mix until combined.",
    "Add the fillet of steak and mix until the steak is evenly coated.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a ramekin and top with melted butter.",
    "Bake for 20 minutes or until the top is golden brown and the steak is cooked to desired doneness.",
    "Let the dish rest for 5 minutes before serving."
